OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to light up Belfast City
OL,4,AHall for Safe Abortion Day to not go
OL,5,Aahead, BBC understands
OL,6,
OL,7,FBelfast City Council said they are now
OL,8,Fseeking legal opinion on "the merits"
OL,9,Fof the call-in procedure used by the
OL,10,FDUP, but BBC News NI understands
OL,11,Fbecause the process will not be
OL,12,Fcompleted by Monday, the lighting of
OL,13,Fthe hall will be delayed.
